When you encounter a challenge, uncertainty, or get stuck, pause and use creative thinking mode.
Actively research best practices, solutions, and modern examples from reputable sources.
Summarize your findings and propose the most effective, concise approach—don’t just repeat previous methods, but adapt or combine ideas if needed.
Always prioritize progress, flexibility, and simplicity over rigid adherence to how things have always been done.